/*!

*\page serial_get SERIAL GET
*
* It reads a string from the terminal. After you press Enter, this instruction returns the string.<BR>
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
*<B> serial_get VARIABLE_NAME</B><BR>
* - <b>VARIABLE_NAME:</b> You must provide the instruction with a variable name. 
*
* <span style='color:blue'><em><B> Example:</B> </em> </span><br>
*	serial_get myText;			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'> rem read a string from terminal </span><br>
* 	print myText;	        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'> rem send the value to terminal  </span><br>
*
*/
